 rust/pin-init/src/__internal.rs       |   8 +-
 rust/pin-init/src/alloc.rs            |   6 +-
 rust/pin-init/src/lib.rs              | 146 ++++++++++----------------
 4 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)

